WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.660 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 4=

01:39.240 --> 01:40.690
I'm feeling generous.

01:41.440 --> 01:42.800
I'm willing to give you another chance.

01:43.210 --> 01:45.130
You've served me well these past
few days.

01:45.570 --> 01:46.240
I'm quite pleased.

01:47.930 --> 01:49.960
Before I recover and take my leave,

01:50.770 --> 01:53.010
if you manage to please me,

01:54.160 --> 01:55.080
then I'll...

01:59.960 --> 02:01.160
I'll take you back with me.

02:02.290 --> 02:03.210
And I'll have you castrated.

02:04.520 --> 02:05.800
You'll become

02:06.130 --> 02:09.130
a eunuch attending to me day and night.

02:15.640 --> 02:16.690
I'm teasing you.

02:17.250 --> 02:18.200
Look how scared you are.

02:21.640 --> 02:22.600
Right here, right now,

02:23.690 --> 02:24.880
I do rather like you.

02:27.760 --> 02:28.850
You always know what to say.

02:29.130 --> 02:30.720
Keep me company
and chat with me tonight.

02:37.570 --> 02:37.970
All right.

02:42.200 --> 02:43.530
That day, the county magistrate said

02:44.850 --> 02:46.250
your father was Yan Zhanzhi.

02:46.810 --> 02:47.880
Why did your whole family

02:48.640 --> 02:49.720
move to Lingnan?

02:55.760 --> 02:56.760
Do you remember

02:57.440 --> 02:58.290
the Rebellion of
the Seven Military Governors?

03:02.480 --> 03:03.160
Ten years ago,

03:03.920 --> 03:05.760
seven military governors led
their troops into the capital.

03:06.160 --> 03:08.530
Sheng'an was engulfed in war,
with marauding soldiers everywhere.

03:09.480 --> 03:11.410
Father fled south with our family.

03:20.060 --> 03:23.540
(The Rebellion of the Seven Military
Governors, The Yan Family Flees South)

03:26.970 --> 03:28.579
(Xie Jinghui, Yan Shang's Mother)
(Here, have this. Eat slowly.)

03:28.621 --> 03:29.460
(Yan Sanlang,
Yan Shang's Younger Brother)

03:30.570 --> 03:31.920
(Young Yan Dalang)
(Come on, eat while it's warm.)

03:38.690 --> 03:39.160
(Stop!)

03:40.370 --> 03:40.850
(Don't run!)

03:43.640 --> 03:44.440
(Run!)

03:46.320 --> 03:46.920
(Run!)

04:08.440 --> 04:09.370
My mother and younger brother

04:10.250 --> 04:11.480
both died in that war.

04:13.090 --> 04:14.010
My elder brother was badly wounded

04:14.440 --> 04:15.200
and was left deeply traumatized.

04:15.850 --> 04:16.690
My father was crippled

04:17.570 --> 04:18.400
and gave himself over to drink
and despair.

04:20.130 --> 04:20.730
From then on,

04:21.730 --> 04:23.010
the gifted Scholar Yan would be no more.

04:25.130 --> 04:27.570
They say the imperial streets
were strewn with nobles' bones.

04:27.840 --> 04:28.490
The Yan family wasn't

04:29.170 --> 04:30.400
the only one wiped out.

04:32.810 --> 04:33.400
That's right.

04:34.880 --> 04:36.440
It wasn't just one family

04:37.760 --> 04:38.880
or one clan

04:39.810 --> 04:40.520
that perished in the Rebellion.

04:46.100 --> 04:47.780
(Young Mu Wanyao)

04:58.080 --> 04:58.570
Yan Shang.

05:01.810 --> 05:02.570
I'm leaving

05:03.960 --> 05:04.930
first thing tomorrow.

05:11.930 --> 05:12.760
Once we part,

05:14.320 --> 05:15.130
we'll likely never

05:15.690 --> 05:16.880
see each other again.

05:20.320 --> 05:21.080
Take care, Your Highness.

05:23.250 --> 05:24.400
It's not even dawn yet,

05:25.370 --> 05:27.200
and you've already lost your resolve
to come along with me?

05:29.610 --> 05:30.570
I've done all I can.

05:31.320 --> 05:31.840
I suppose

05:32.880 --> 05:33.880
this can't be forced.

05:40.610 --> 05:41.640
I've always had trouble sleeping.

05:42.930 --> 05:43.960
Since this is our last night,

05:45.960 --> 05:47.280
tell me a story.

05:48.490 --> 05:49.760
If it helps me sleep soundly,

05:50.440 --> 05:51.880
I'll grant your request.

05:53.010 --> 05:53.440
How about it?

06:19.400 --> 06:20.050
Go ahead.

06:24.760 --> 06:26.520
Lingnan has many strange tales.

06:27.880 --> 06:29.170
My favorite of them all

06:30.250 --> 06:31.280
is called Lady Jiang.

06:33.050 --> 06:36.810
Legend says a woman of the Jiang clan
once went into the mountains for herbs.

06:37.960 --> 06:38.370
But then,

06:39.570 --> 06:40.490
she encountered a tiger.

06:44.280 --> 06:45.170
Did it eat her?

06:46.570 --> 06:47.640
With the tiger's sharp claws and fangs,

06:48.170 --> 06:49.170
a frail woman like her

06:49.730 --> 06:50.730
could never fight it off.

06:51.640 --> 06:52.050
So,

06:52.840 --> 06:54.170
she made a dire wager

06:54.810 --> 06:55.810
with the tiger.

06:56.690 --> 06:57.280
What was the wager?

06:58.170 --> 06:58.640
She said,

06:59.690 --> 07:01.610
"Meeting you today,
I know I won't survive.

07:02.640 --> 07:03.690
If you consume me entirely,

07:04.200 --> 07:05.080
I'll die without complaint.

07:05.960 --> 07:06.400
But,

07:07.050 --> 07:08.130
if you fail to eat me,

07:09.010 --> 07:11.010
even if I die
and become a vengeful spirit,

07:11.930 --> 07:13.130
I'll never let you go."

07:24.840 --> 07:26.050
The tiger began to devour her.

07:27.050 --> 07:28.810
It had almost devoured her completely.

07:37.200 --> 07:39.880
(The daughter of the Yaoguang Star
will bring prosperity to the dynasty.)

07:40.490 --> 07:42.370
(Given the Princess's auspicious name,)

07:42.610 --> 07:45.610
(she's the ideal bride for Meng Baiyu.)

07:47.370 --> 07:48.760
(Once the Princess marries,)

07:49.520 --> 07:51.690
(North Jing will know peace.)

07:56.170 --> 07:57.400
The disparity in strength was immense.

07:58.320 --> 07:59.570
Defeat seemed inevitable.

08:04.080 --> 08:04.610
And yet,

08:05.320 --> 08:07.200
a piece of her little finger
fell into a crack.

08:08.170 --> 08:09.610
However hard the tiger clawed,

08:10.200 --> 08:10.930
it couldn't get it out.

08:12.050 --> 08:12.760
At daybreak the next morning,

08:13.570 --> 08:14.690
the villagers were astonished

08:15.640 --> 08:17.610
to see her dressed in crimson,
riding the tiger

08:18.400 --> 08:19.080
back home.

08:20.400 --> 08:21.130
She had won the wager.

08:22.690 --> 08:23.170
She said,

08:24.520 --> 08:25.170
"Starting today,

08:25.960 --> 08:27.440
I am the tiger's master."

08:36.040 --> 08:36.520
That's the end.

08:38.680 --> 08:39.450
Get some rest, my lady.

08:52.680 --> 08:53.370
(At that moment,)

08:54.610 --> 08:56.920
(my heart thundered in my chest
and my blood ran hot,)

08:58.450 --> 08:59.520
(yet I felt no fear.)

09:00.920 --> 09:02.680
(What I'd long kept hidden in my heart)

09:03.160 --> 09:04.370
(had been laid bare by his words.)

09:05.040 --> 09:06.680
(The tiger lurking in my heart)

09:07.520 --> 09:08.610
(could no longer be restrained.)

09:10.330 --> 09:10.850
(That's right.)

09:12.280 --> 09:13.490
(No more shrinking back or hesitation.)

09:14.760 --> 09:16.450
(Moving forward is just one big gamble.)

09:17.090 --> 09:17.680
(If I lose,)

09:18.490 --> 09:19.400
(I die, that's all.)

09:20.250 --> 09:20.920
(If I win,)

09:21.640 --> 09:23.130
(I become the tiger's master.)

09:52.800 --> 09:53.760
That's a wonderful story.

09:54.520 --> 09:55.680
It speaks right to my heart.

09:59.130 --> 09:59.560
Yan Shang,

10:00.400 --> 10:01.090
what do you want?

10:09.250 --> 10:10.040
I want to go to Sheng'an

10:10.760 --> 10:11.730
and enroll at the Imperial Academy.

10:13.280 --> 10:13.560
All right.

10:14.400 --> 10:15.010
I promise.

10:49.920 --> 10:50.490
Shang.

10:58.850 --> 10:59.250
Father.

11:03.160 --> 11:03.850
Are you leaving?

11:11.010 --> 11:11.640
I've failed you as a son.

11:12.370 --> 11:13.490
I can no longer stay to care for you.

11:21.160 --> 11:22.250
Sheng'an is a vast place.

11:23.130 --> 11:24.040
Plenty of room for you
to make your mark.

11:25.610 --> 11:28.160
I've spent my life achieving little,
and now I'm old with nothing to show.

11:29.490 --> 11:30.640
If there's one thing I'm proud of,

11:31.800 --> 11:32.490
it's you.

11:36.880 --> 11:37.330
Go on.

11:42.660 --> 11:44.640
♪Books bear no blade♪

11:46.280 --> 11:50.910
♪Yet tens of thousands of scrolls
can pierce the sky♪

11:52.040 --> 11:53.679
Sheng'an may be vast,
but it's not easy to live there.

11:53.721 --> 11:55.560
♪My body is the furnace,
flames reach the clouds♪

11:56.450 --> 11:58.560
If one day you've had enough
and grown tired of it,

11:59.010 --> 11:59.920
come back to Lingnan.

12:01.090 --> 12:02.280
Whatever fortunes life brings,

12:04.850 --> 12:05.640
you'll always have a home here.

12:06.690 --> 12:10.460
♪In all I do, I have no regrets♪

12:13.450 --> 12:13.970
What's wrong?

12:16.820 --> 12:20.120
♪With the world in my heart,
I leave the shore♪

12:20.970 --> 12:21.449
Nothing.

12:21.491 --> 12:26.060
♪With rain ahead, I cross the pass♪

12:26.360 --> 12:29.690
♪Who'll wait with me for the boat home?♪

12:31.060 --> 12:33.220
♪By noon, the mist will lift♪

12:33.450 --> 12:33.850
Father...

12:36.160 --> 12:36.520
Take care.

12:40.490 --> 12:45.160
♪With rosy clouds,
I bid the moon goodnight♪

12:45.860 --> 12:48.820
♪And trade my old robes for new♪

12:52.520 --> 12:52.970
Shang,

12:54.520 --> 12:55.970
take good care of yourself on the road.

12:59.760 --> 13:00.130
I will.

13:00.800 --> 13:01.400
Don't fall ill.

13:06.090 --> 13:06.560
Brother,

13:08.330 --> 13:09.090
safe travels.

13:16.850 --> 13:17.280
Xiaozhou,

13:18.800 --> 13:19.520
if one day

13:20.560 --> 13:21.250
I can return,

13:22.520 --> 13:22.970
from then on,

13:24.210 --> 13:25.130
our family will stay together

13:26.250 --> 13:27.160
and spend the rest of our lives

13:27.970 --> 13:28.640
in this little thatched cottage.

13:32.560 --> 13:33.330
If I don't return,

13:35.970 --> 13:36.450
you'll have to

13:37.370 --> 13:38.370
keep this family going.

13:39.730 --> 13:40.370
Our elder brother has had it hard.

13:41.450 --> 13:42.450
Take good care of Father.

13:47.680 --> 13:48.210
Brother...

13:51.010 --> 13:52.130
Must you really go?

14:02.400 --> 14:02.850
Brother!

14:04.210 --> 14:05.280
Remember to write to us.

14:05.560 --> 14:07.160
Father and I can read your letters
to our brother.

14:08.250 --> 14:11.800
♪I still fear my ambitions
may go unfulfilled♪

14:16.970 --> 14:17.330
I will!

14:22.420 --> 14:27.020
♪I gaze at high peaks
and sails far away♪

14:27.520 --> 14:30.720
♪With the world in my heart,
I leave the shore♪

14:31.690 --> 14:36.720
♪Frost on my shoulders,
joys and sorrows stretch afar♪

14:37.090 --> 14:40.320
♪A thousand miles of lights
keep me company♪

14:41.660 --> 14:43.860
♪By noon, the mist will lift♪

14:44.060 --> 14:46.290
♪Rivers will bend♪

14:46.690 --> 14:49.820
♪Today, lean on the rail with me again♪

14:51.220 --> 14:56.400
♪Tread the boundless clouds
and rise with the wind♪

14:56.450 --> 14:59.340
♪March to the gates
with fearless hearts♪

15:11.160 --> 15:11.680
Yan Shang,

15:12.490 --> 15:13.370
have you thought this through?

15:14.400 --> 15:16.210
Sheng'an's no easy place to live.

15:17.490 --> 15:18.520
Across the whole Huai Dynasty,

15:18.920 --> 15:20.970
every predator is packed into Sheng'an.

15:21.800 --> 15:23.040
Whether it's intelligence,

15:23.400 --> 15:24.090
scheming,

15:24.520 --> 15:25.250
flattery,

15:25.880 --> 15:26.560
or influence,

15:27.280 --> 15:28.490
someone will always outdo you.

15:29.640 --> 15:31.640
Every day, every moment,

15:32.210 --> 15:33.560
they're locked in fierce competition.

15:41.210 --> 15:41.970
Listen,

15:42.370 --> 15:43.920
don't think being clever

15:44.640 --> 15:47.160
means you'll make a name for yourself
at the Imperial Academy.

15:47.490 --> 15:48.920
I grew up in Sheng'an.

15:49.850 --> 15:52.730
I've seen countless brilliant people

15:52.920 --> 15:53.760
never get the chance they deserve

15:54.280 --> 15:55.010
and live out ordinary lives.

15:59.560 --> 16:00.250
Thank you for the warning.

16:01.210 --> 16:01.520
Your Highness,

16:02.280 --> 16:02.970
we're ready to depart.

16:14.400 --> 16:15.130
Shang!

17:28.040 --> 17:28.650
What are you writing?

17:28.740 --> 17:29.740
(Dear Brother and Sister, greetings.
Ten days on, a thousand li apart.)

17:30.520 --> 17:30.890
A letter home.

17:31.890 --> 17:33.560
I'll send them all home together
once we reach Sheng'an.

17:34.120 --> 17:36.450
"Dear Brother and Sister, greetings.

17:36.930 --> 17:38.080
Ten days on,

17:38.210 --> 17:39.800
a thousand li apart."

17:41.490 --> 17:41.890
How nice it must be

17:42.280 --> 17:43.320
to get a letter like that.

17:44.760 --> 17:46.250
I've never gotten a letter from anyone.

17:56.730 --> 17:57.970
We're nearly at Sheng'an.

17:59.010 --> 18:00.760
You'd better spend less time
on trivial matters

18:01.520 --> 18:02.690
and more time reading poetry and prose.

18:03.210 --> 18:05.170
Imitate the masters
and submit your work.

18:05.520 --> 18:07.280
That's the shortcut to success
for a scholar.

18:09.890 --> 18:10.360
What a shame.

18:11.120 --> 18:11.890
I'm no good at writing poetry

18:12.520 --> 18:13.250
and I don't even like reading it.

18:14.890 --> 18:15.840
That's not good.

18:21.320 --> 18:21.890
Fang Tong,

18:23.490 --> 18:24.410
where are we now?

18:25.210 --> 18:25.730
My lady,

18:26.170 --> 18:27.170
we're almost at Lantian Relay Station.

18:30.080 --> 18:31.360
How come it's starting to rain?

18:54.010 --> 18:54.490
My lady,

18:55.120 --> 18:55.760
the rain is too heavy.

18:56.010 --> 18:56.840
Let's wait a while before we go on.

18:57.210 --> 18:58.450
There could be mudslides and rockfalls.

18:58.890 --> 18:59.250
All right.

19:05.560 --> 19:05.890
Speak.

19:08.450 --> 19:09.320
Your wound has only just healed.

19:10.280 --> 19:11.280
Go easy on the wine.

19:12.730 --> 19:13.800
You do like to meddle.

19:40.280 --> 19:40.930
What are you doing?

19:41.730 --> 19:42.040
I...

19:43.170 --> 19:44.120
I'm covering your ears.

19:45.890 --> 19:46.730
How did you know?

19:48.520 --> 19:49.320
That day in the cave,

19:49.840 --> 19:50.629
you had a terrible fever...

19:50.671 --> 19:51.040
Shut up!

20:11.650 --> 20:12.010
Your Highness,

20:12.970 --> 20:13.490
the rain has stopped.

20:28.120 --> 20:29.080
What else do you know?

20:31.010 --> 20:31.520
Nothing else.

20:33.040 --> 20:33.760
Tell me the truth.

20:37.040 --> 20:37.760
If I do,

20:39.800 --> 20:41.080
you might get angry.

20:41.520 --> 20:42.730
You think I'll be pleased

20:43.560 --> 20:44.800
if you stop halfway through?

20:47.080 --> 20:47.490
Speak!

20:50.930 --> 20:51.690
I also know

20:53.210 --> 20:54.520
that perhaps on a stormy night,

20:55.800 --> 20:56.730
someone tried to kill you.

20:57.730 --> 20:59.650
You were in grave danger,
on the brink of death,

21:01.360 --> 21:02.410
and it left you traumatized.

21:03.170 --> 21:03.800
Go on.

21:06.360 --> 21:07.010
Perhaps it happened

21:09.410 --> 21:11.080
when you were married off to North Jing.

21:14.040 --> 21:14.450
I'm sorry.

21:17.250 --> 21:17.840
Yan Shang,

21:18.690 --> 21:19.730
if you dare tell anyone

21:20.120 --> 21:21.690
what we discussed today,

21:22.410 --> 21:24.170
I'll rip out your tendons
and skin you alive!

21:24.730 --> 21:25.170
I promise.

21:25.650 --> 21:26.490
I won't tell a soul.

21:35.410 --> 21:37.280
The Sheng'an you've longed for
is right ahead.

21:38.010 --> 21:39.080
I'll give you this chance

21:39.760 --> 21:41.360
to reach it on your own.

21:42.320 --> 21:43.450
Fang Tong, let's go.

21:43.560 --> 21:43.890
Understood.

22:22.260 --> 22:24.020
(Sheng'an)

22:24.650 --> 22:26.019
(Come have a look!)

22:26.061 --> 22:27.930
(Hot steamed buns!)

22:28.650 --> 22:31.210
(Fresh out of the steamer!)

22:31.730 --> 22:33.810
(Come and see!)

22:34.420 --> 22:36.860
♪In the name her father gave♪

22:37.820 --> 22:43.690
♪Into savage lands, to tame tigers
and slay wolves♪

22:45.660 --> 22:51.060
♪The fate is sealed,
a destiny bestowed by Heaven♪

22:52.090 --> 22:58.420
♪When did you decide to defy it,
to change it?♪

23:00.020 --> 23:06.690
♪Defy its might,
and the submission it demands♪

23:07.220 --> 23:12.860
♪Defy its scorn,
stain the sky with blood♪

23:15.020 --> 23:19.060
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

23:19.110 --> 23:22.220
♪Don't be afraid,
I'll become a demon for you♪

23:22.290 --> 23:25.090
♪Through fire, I'll turn the
dark towers♪

23:25.490 --> 23:28.490
♪Bright as day for you♪

23:28.920 --> 23:31.190
♪Though this world is hard to cross♪

23:31.240 --> 23:32.720
♪I'll lead you through♪

23:33.030 --> 23:35.820
♪I dare face the unknown,
with my sword in hand♪

23:36.190 --> 23:40.890
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers,
breach the city gates♪

23:49.410 --> 23:50.520
(If you wish to fight a tiger,)

23:51.520 --> 23:52.560
(you must first risk your life.)

23:54.010 --> 23:58.310
(This is my hunting ground.)

23:58.840 --> 23:59.410
(Sheng'an,)

23:59.690 --> 24:01.930
(I'm back.)

24:03.090 --> 24:05.680
♪One song of slaughter follows another♪

24:22.170 --> 24:23.450
(I don't know when it began,)

24:23.690 --> 24:26.010
(but Sheng'an says you're overbearing)

24:26.280 --> 24:27.650
(and won't let the people eat fish.)

24:28.650 --> 24:31.170
(The Eastern Palace
accepting sea bass now)

24:31.840 --> 24:32.840
(may have an ulterior motive.)

24:35.320 --> 24:38.760
(Yu Cheng'an, Duke of Zhao, Cav. Gen.)
I forbid the people from eating fish?

24:39.760 --> 24:41.890
(Army-Inspection Commissioner)
This rumor is quite telling.

24:44.120 --> 24:44.970
(If that's the case,)

24:45.600 --> 24:46.760
(for a treacherous eunuch like me,)

24:47.170 --> 24:49.650
(I can least afford to
disappoint the Crown Prince.)

25:00.820 --> 25:06.220
(Mu Yu, Emperor)

25:14.450 --> 25:16.080
I heard that yesterday,

25:16.650 --> 25:17.600
a guest visited the Eastern Palace

25:18.040 --> 25:21.210
and presented Your Highness
with two sea bass.

25:21.800 --> 25:22.520
Is that true?

25:23.280 --> 25:23.890
Perhaps yes.

25:25.120 --> 25:25.800
(Mu Xun, Crown Prince)
Perhaps not.

25:27.490 --> 25:28.320
I never concern myself

25:29.520 --> 25:30.280
with kitchen matters.

25:35.930 --> 25:36.960
Oh,

25:37.970 --> 25:38.520
Your Highness,

25:40.650 --> 25:42.210
you're so young

25:42.490 --> 25:43.760
yet your memory is already failing.

25:44.890 --> 25:46.040
I've heard that

25:46.520 --> 25:49.280
you not only accepted the fish

25:49.360 --> 25:50.730
and ate them after they were cooked,

25:50.840 --> 25:52.410
but even rewarded the man
who brought them.

25:53.800 --> 25:54.450
Who would've thought

25:55.320 --> 25:56.560
even trifles about
the Eastern Palace's meals

25:58.210 --> 26:00.040
would reach your ears.

26:03.320 --> 26:04.360
Every matter in Sheng'an,

26:05.170 --> 26:06.410
great or small,

26:07.450 --> 26:10.840
concerns the safety
of the imperial nobility.

26:11.760 --> 26:12.250
I am duty-bound

26:13.080 --> 26:14.010
to inquire.

26:17.600 --> 26:17.970
Your Highness,

26:20.890 --> 26:22.120
just tell me one thing.

26:23.080 --> 26:24.210
Did you receive

26:24.560 --> 26:25.320
those two fish

26:25.930 --> 26:27.040
or not?

26:38.280 --> 26:38.760
Xun.

26:40.250 --> 26:40.730
Xun.

26:44.520 --> 26:44.890
Your Majesty.

26:46.320 --> 26:47.410
Who would've thought?

26:48.450 --> 26:50.650
Two mere sea bass

26:51.600 --> 26:53.250
could make the heir to the throne

26:54.450 --> 26:55.280
so reluctant to answer.

26:57.930 --> 26:58.450
Cheng'an,

26:59.280 --> 27:00.890
Xun is still a child.

27:01.410 --> 27:02.690
Impulsive and hot-tempered,

27:03.760 --> 27:04.690
with a poor memory too.

27:05.360 --> 27:07.170
Don't hold it against him.

27:24.840 --> 27:26.760
Why is Your Highness sweating so much?

27:27.970 --> 27:28.730
Could it be

27:29.360 --> 27:30.730
the cold night air

27:31.730 --> 27:33.040
has given you a chill?

27:34.010 --> 27:35.320
You're in the prime of life,

27:36.210 --> 27:37.650
yet so frail.

27:41.520 --> 27:42.600
For the sake of the realm,

27:43.410 --> 27:45.250
you must take better care of yourself.

28:01.210 --> 28:01.970
Cheng'an,

28:03.360 --> 28:04.690
let it go.

28:05.450 --> 28:06.320
After all,

28:06.930 --> 28:09.040
you've watched him grow up.

28:12.010 --> 28:12.560
Xun,

28:13.210 --> 28:14.840
apologize to Lord Yu,

28:15.730 --> 28:16.730
and

28:17.760 --> 28:19.410
let this matter be settled.

28:23.320 --> 28:23.730
Xun.

28:44.040 --> 28:44.970
Greetings, Lord Yu.

28:45.600 --> 28:46.410
Greetings, Father.

28:47.690 --> 28:48.520
I'm back.

28:48.800 --> 28:49.320
Danyang, you're back.

28:53.690 --> 28:54.280
Rise.

28:54.730 --> 28:55.360
Thank you, Father.

29:00.520 --> 29:01.650
Brother Xun, you're here too.

29:20.800 --> 29:21.650
Princess Danyang.

29:23.120 --> 29:23.760
Is there...

29:25.600 --> 29:27.930
Is there something on my face?

29:31.930 --> 29:33.250
It's been a long time, Lord Yu.

29:34.080 --> 29:35.320
I've missed you.

29:36.280 --> 29:37.280
On this trip south,

29:37.760 --> 29:39.840
I picked up lots of local specialties.

29:40.890 --> 29:41.690
As soon as I returned,

29:41.840 --> 29:43.490
I sent them straight to your residence.

29:44.320 --> 29:45.320
But you weren't there.

29:46.010 --> 29:46.690
I guessed

29:46.970 --> 29:49.080
you must be in the palace
chatting with Father.

29:51.760 --> 29:52.600
It seems

29:53.170 --> 29:55.040
Your Highness enjoyed

29:55.410 --> 29:57.080
your trip very much.

29:57.800 --> 29:58.600
Not at all.

29:59.690 --> 30:00.760
This trip south

30:01.040 --> 30:02.690
was to pray for my mother's soul
and help her spirit find peace.

30:03.360 --> 30:04.930
I wouldn't dare indulge myself.

30:07.800 --> 30:08.280
Is that so?

30:09.360 --> 30:11.730
Then why have I heard

30:12.210 --> 30:14.080
that along the way, you...

30:15.490 --> 30:16.650
Lord Yu,

30:17.650 --> 30:18.760
please stop.

30:19.450 --> 30:20.930
Brother Xun is still here.

30:21.760 --> 30:22.760
If you say it,

30:23.280 --> 30:24.010
I'll never be able

30:24.730 --> 30:26.080
to show my face again.

30:28.320 --> 30:29.320
What is it?

30:29.840 --> 30:31.280
Now I'm quite eager to hear.

30:32.040 --> 30:32.600
Xun,

30:33.360 --> 30:34.170
you may leave.

30:35.970 --> 30:36.320
Yes, Father.

30:37.120 --> 30:39.080
Please wait, Your Highness!

30:52.560 --> 30:53.410
Your Highness,

30:55.080 --> 30:58.080
you should heed the lessons
of those before you.

31:04.080 --> 31:04.360
That's right.

31:05.040 --> 31:05.650
Xun,

31:06.120 --> 31:07.080
when you return,

31:07.280 --> 31:09.730
deal with those cooks from yesterday.

31:11.040 --> 31:12.040
From now on,

31:12.800 --> 31:14.040
be careful with all ingredients

31:14.600 --> 31:16.040
going in and out of the kitchen.

31:21.600 --> 31:22.040
Yes, Father.

31:43.360 --> 31:44.490
I was wrong.

31:46.930 --> 31:47.520
Cheng'an,

31:48.490 --> 31:49.760
what has she done wrong again?

31:55.560 --> 31:57.170
She hasn't exactly done anything wrong.

31:59.250 --> 32:01.210
Princess Danyang was merely

32:01.600 --> 32:02.690
indulging in a little youthful romance.

32:03.120 --> 32:04.040
It's harmless enough.

32:04.560 --> 32:05.280
Youthful romance?

32:09.280 --> 32:10.520
Father,

32:12.890 --> 32:14.450
I know I was wrong.

32:17.840 --> 32:18.250
Your Majesty,

32:19.250 --> 32:21.490
enjoy your reunion
with Princess Danyang.

32:21.800 --> 32:23.690
I'll take my leave now.

32:24.840 --> 32:25.970
Lord Yu, rest...

32:31.600 --> 32:33.040
Lord Yu, rest well.

32:33.490 --> 32:35.080
And take care of yourself.

32:35.730 --> 32:36.650
Thank you, Your Majesty!

32:45.080 --> 32:45.600
Father,

32:46.730 --> 32:47.520
the weather's turned cold

32:48.360 --> 32:49.840
and your old ailment
has flared up again.

32:56.210 --> 32:57.080
It's nothing.

33:01.010 --> 33:01.840
But look at you.

33:02.520 --> 33:03.210
You must have

33:04.250 --> 33:04.930
had a hard journey.

33:06.280 --> 33:07.490
Being out on the road

33:08.170 --> 33:08.800
isn't hard on me.

33:09.450 --> 33:10.600
But you remain in the palace,

33:11.890 --> 33:12.730
unable to leave.

33:13.890 --> 33:14.600
You're the one who's had it hard.

33:20.120 --> 33:22.520
Here's Princess Danyang's gift list.

33:23.490 --> 33:24.970
The gifts are in the reception hall.

33:25.250 --> 33:26.040
Would you like to look it over?

33:26.690 --> 33:27.120
No need.

33:27.690 --> 33:28.840
Handle them as you see fit.

33:29.840 --> 33:30.210
By the way,

33:30.730 --> 33:31.469
(Zheng Xing, Palace Attendant)
besides my residence,

33:31.511 --> 33:32.800
where else did she send gifts?

33:33.970 --> 33:35.490
The Liangyi Hall and the Eastern Palace.

33:36.730 --> 33:38.360
What did she send to the Eastern Palace?

33:39.010 --> 33:41.450
Female musicians bought in the south.

33:43.410 --> 33:44.450
Danyang...

33:45.040 --> 33:46.120
She really doesn't know

33:47.040 --> 33:48.450
how to cater to anyone's tastes.

33:59.730 --> 34:00.760
You're truly wise, Godfather.

34:02.890 --> 34:04.840
I heard the cooks at the Eastern Palace

34:05.040 --> 34:06.250
have all been taken care of.

34:13.600 --> 34:14.010
Your Highness.

34:14.930 --> 34:16.160
Endurance is a blade over the heart.

34:17.080 --> 34:18.290
I know how much you're suffering.

34:19.450 --> 34:20.160
But for now,

34:20.970 --> 34:21.770
please endure a little longer.

34:26.970 --> 34:28.240
One day,

34:29.720 --> 34:31.680
that treacherous eunuch
will surely be killed.

34:33.450 --> 34:34.520
And this realm

34:36.010 --> 34:37.560
will belong to the Mu clan in the end.

34:53.970 --> 34:54.410
What is it?

34:55.330 --> 34:56.810
(Yu Niang, Eastern Palace Adviser)
Princess Danyang has sent gifts.

34:57.160 --> 34:58.520
They request that
Your Highness receive them in person.

35:09.930 --> 35:11.160
Thank your lady for her kindness.

35:12.200 --> 35:13.200
Go back where you came from.

35:17.680 --> 35:18.600
The gesture is appreciated.

35:19.200 --> 35:20.520
I'll escort you ladies back.

35:39.330 --> 35:39.850
You?

35:41.240 --> 35:42.890
Will Your Highness be free tonight?

35:44.290 --> 35:46.770
I'd like to play a piece for you.

35:47.520 --> 35:48.680
Prince of Qin Breaking the Battle Array.

35:51.720 --> 35:52.080
All right.

36:00.600 --> 36:00.930
Danyang,

36:02.160 --> 36:02.930
did Father ask you

36:03.490 --> 36:04.490
to pass me a message?

36:05.120 --> 36:05.600
Your Highness,

36:06.560 --> 36:07.770
Princess Danyang

36:08.120 --> 36:09.290
is drinking at Cuiyun Tower tonight.

36:10.040 --> 36:11.120
She hasn't been to the Eastern Palace
tonight.

36:15.290 --> 36:16.200
What exactly is this about?

36:17.370 --> 36:18.080
This is no place

36:18.520 --> 36:19.810
for you to make trouble.

36:20.560 --> 36:21.010
I came

36:21.720 --> 36:22.640
for one reason only.

36:39.810 --> 36:41.410
If Your Highness wishes to achieve
this great cause,

36:42.520 --> 36:43.850
I am willing to be your blade.

36:51.410 --> 36:51.810
Danyang,

36:53.640 --> 36:54.200
tell me,

36:55.850 --> 36:57.200
is it as I suspect?

36:58.080 --> 36:58.640
In the past,

36:59.930 --> 37:01.040
I had no choice.

37:02.720 --> 37:03.560
But now that I've returned,

37:04.290 --> 37:05.490
I refuse to keep living in a daze.

37:06.930 --> 37:09.290
I'm willing to help you
kill that treacherous eunuch,

37:10.010 --> 37:11.240
reclaim power over the realm,

37:11.850 --> 37:13.200
and avenge the humiliation of our clan!

37:15.120 --> 37:15.560
Danyang,

37:17.080 --> 37:18.120
I underestimated

37:19.010 --> 37:19.810
you before.

37:20.450 --> 37:21.600
I realized it too late.

37:23.560 --> 37:24.810
You and I are both of the Mu clan.

37:25.850 --> 37:27.930
We share honor and shame,
life and death.

37:28.930 --> 37:29.410
In the past,

37:30.160 --> 37:31.490
I gave in to despair

37:32.520 --> 37:33.450
and hid away just to stay alive.

37:34.930 --> 37:35.810
Starting today,

37:36.810 --> 37:38.600
I'll do all I can to help you.

37:40.010 --> 37:41.200
I'm willing to do whatever it takes

37:42.080 --> 37:42.850
for this cause,

37:43.330 --> 37:44.160
fighting to the death!

38:21.100 --> 38:25.020
(Your Highness.)

38:28.520 --> 38:29.240
(By now,)

38:30.290 --> 38:31.370
(she must've reached Sheng'an.)

38:33.680 --> 38:34.770
(Heaven's favored daughter)

38:35.720 --> 38:36.640
(has returned home
from ten thousand li away.)

38:38.330 --> 38:39.770
(She must be fast asleep by now.)

38:59.890 --> 39:00.370
Brother,

39:01.680 --> 39:02.490
there's something

39:03.490 --> 39:04.600
I have no one else to ask.

39:06.010 --> 39:08.080
Less than six months
after I married into North Jing,

39:08.930 --> 39:10.410
I heard of Mother's death.

39:12.010 --> 39:13.890
But I remember
she was always in good health.

39:15.970 --> 39:16.520
How exactly

39:17.290 --> 39:18.370
did Mother die?

39:24.240 --> 39:25.120
It's a well-kept secret.

39:25.890 --> 39:26.680
Even I don't know

39:27.600 --> 39:28.520
the full story.

39:28.970 --> 39:29.680
I've only heard rumors.

39:30.560 --> 39:31.330
I heard

39:31.770 --> 39:33.160
that Father and Mother plotted

39:33.600 --> 39:35.160
to lure Lord Yu into the palace
and kill him.

39:35.930 --> 39:37.040
But the plan was exposed

39:37.560 --> 39:38.410
and failed at the last moment.

39:38.930 --> 39:39.680
That treacherous eunuch confined

39:40.410 --> 39:41.330
both Father and Mother.

39:43.810 --> 39:44.410
Mother

39:45.330 --> 39:46.290
had a fiery temper

39:47.330 --> 39:48.200
and died by cutting her own throat.

39:50.450 --> 39:52.600
Father fell ill with grief

39:54.010 --> 39:55.370
and has remained ill ever since.

39:59.560 --> 40:01.080
It must be the deepest wound

40:02.010 --> 40:03.240
of Father's life.

40:07.680 --> 40:08.890
I'm glad I asked you

40:09.490 --> 40:10.200
and not Father.

40:12.040 --> 40:13.490
Though I wasn't born to Mother,

40:15.160 --> 40:16.010
she always treated me

40:16.640 --> 40:17.600
as if I were her own.

40:19.240 --> 40:21.080
You're the only daughter Mother bore.

40:21.680 --> 40:22.160
Now,

40:23.080 --> 40:24.160
her soul rests in the underworld.

40:25.240 --> 40:26.240
As your elder brother,

40:27.720 --> 40:29.040
I should take good care of you.

40:30.490 --> 40:31.370
Danyang, don't worry.

40:32.080 --> 40:33.120
Whether we succeed or fail,

40:34.160 --> 40:36.120
I'll do all I can to keep you safe.

40:38.490 --> 40:38.930
Brother,

40:40.970 --> 40:41.850
if I feared death,

40:42.770 --> 40:43.810
would I have come to you?

40:45.640 --> 40:46.410
Our alliance

40:48.560 --> 40:49.680
matters a great deal.

40:50.330 --> 40:51.330
The fewer people who know,

40:52.200 --> 40:53.120
the safer you'll be.

40:54.520 --> 40:55.330
Just now,

40:55.680 --> 40:56.810
I thought of a solution.

40:59.640 --> 41:01.080
Do you remember my study companion,

41:02.200 --> 41:03.120
the Yang family's third son,

41:03.640 --> 41:04.160
Yang Si?

41:06.810 --> 41:08.640
You and Yang Si
were childhood sweethearts.

41:09.490 --> 41:10.600
Everyone in the palace saw it.

41:12.040 --> 41:13.240
Yang Si is my study companion.

41:14.680 --> 41:16.330
Being close to me is part of his duty.

41:17.810 --> 41:18.290
How about

41:19.240 --> 41:20.560
I arrange your marriage to him?

41:21.520 --> 41:22.370
With Yang Si by your side,

41:23.040 --> 41:24.040
he'll also do all he can

41:24.640 --> 41:25.410
to keep you safe.

41:28.640 --> 41:29.120
Brother,

41:30.240 --> 41:31.680
it's been years since I saw Yang Si.

41:33.290 --> 41:35.010
Our alliance concerns
our clan and the realm.

41:36.600 --> 41:37.970
No need to involve marriage.

41:42.890 --> 41:43.290
Danyang,

41:44.490 --> 41:45.370
I trust you, of course.

41:46.200 --> 41:47.450
But this would provide
another layer of cover

41:48.330 --> 41:49.600
and reduce the risks considerably.

41:50.770 --> 41:51.520
Even without this alliance

41:51.850 --> 41:53.010
between us,

41:54.290 --> 41:55.160
with Yang Si involved,

41:56.120 --> 41:57.720
we can still act in concert.

41:59.890 --> 42:00.160
All right.

42:01.160 --> 42:01.770
I understand.

42:04.450 --> 42:05.370
I'm a woman, after all.

42:06.160 --> 42:07.040
Let me

42:07.810 --> 42:08.560
think it over.

42:11.010 --> 42:11.370
That's fair.

42:14.200 --> 42:15.010
Our lives are already

42:15.850 --> 42:16.890
in each other's hands.

42:17.810 --> 42:18.240
From now on,

42:19.200 --> 42:20.080
there's nothing we can't discuss.

42:24.890 --> 42:25.640
It's late.

42:25.970 --> 42:27.330
I'll take my leave.

42:28.120 --> 42:29.490
Let's discuss this further another day.

42:48.200 --> 42:48.720
(Mu Xun,)

42:49.970 --> 42:52.010
(you're counting your chickens
far too early.)

42:55.330 --> 42:56.080
(Or perhaps)

42:57.560 --> 42:59.810
(you don't even bother
hiding your intentions from me.)

43:03.220 --> 43:07.660
(Next Episode Preview)

43:11.490 --> 43:11.850
Your Highness.

43:13.520 --> 43:14.010
Qilang,

43:14.080 --> 43:15.930
come visit my residence tonight.

43:17.080 --> 43:18.640
Don't you want to be my Prince Consort?

43:18.890 --> 43:19.850
Why do you keep avoiding me?

43:20.410 --> 43:22.520
Just stay the night here.

43:24.721 --> 43:28.014
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

43:30.699 --> 43:35.615
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

43:37.809 --> 43:43.654
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

43:44.154 --> 43:49.380
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

43:52.149 --> 43:56.940
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

43:57.776 --> 44:03.855
♪Through trails of mud and blood;
let grief drown in your eyes♪

44:05.656 --> 44:08.806
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

44:08.806 --> 44:10.454
♪Burning bright as a song♪

44:10.506 --> 44:14.230
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

44:14.608 --> 44:19.274
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

44:19.893 --> 44:23.934
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

44:24.425 --> 44:26.540
♪Not a single hour less♪

44:26.580 --> 44:33.526
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

44:34.289 --> 44:37.742
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

44:37.922 --> 44:41.067
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

44:41.506 --> 44:48.143
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

44:48.540 --> 44:53.054
♪May time be free of fear and pain;
boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

44:53.092 --> 44:55.561
♪You're the only one I need♪

44:55.765 --> 45:02.652
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

45:02.964 --> 45:06.235
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

45:06.540 --> 45:09.713
♪My last untouched innocence♪

45:10.037 --> 45:13.463
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

45:13.696 --> 45:16.921
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

45:17.252 --> 45:24.048
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

45:24.417 --> 45:28.983
♪May time be free of fear and pain;
boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

45:29.030 --> 45:31.368
♪You're the only one I need♪

45:31.599 --> 45:38.434
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

45:38.783 --> 45:40.401
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

45:40.531 --> 45:42.327
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

45:42.684 --> 45:45.701
♪You're the only one I need♪

45:45.741 --> 45:47.068
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
